WEBVTT

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:16.884
Holding you and kissing you enough to bask in

00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:23.090
Fighting and loving each other enough to bask in

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:29.296
I want to know you, just as you are

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:35.035
But I'm the one who can't just be myself

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:38.171
I don't understand

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.908
Your heart

00:00:41.508 --> 00:00:42.910
Why is it?

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:47.548
Are you really a sorceress then?

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:51.718
I want to hold you

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.322
Alone, I cry

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:59.993
I don't ever want to be alone again

00:01:01.328 --> 00:01:04.331
I want to hold you

00:01:04.331 --> 00:01:07.634
With you, I fly

00:01:08.035 --> 00:01:15.409
I melt into the emotional voice
that almost seems to be crying

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:21.915
Serenade

00:02:00.387 --> 00:02:01.321
Childman...

00:02:01.321 --> 00:02:03.457
I warn you. Do not hinder me, Krylancelo.

00:02:03.457 --> 00:02:06.793
Should you prove a hindrance again,
I shall kill you.

00:02:07.094 --> 00:02:08.528
| thought I told you.

00:02:08.528 --> 00:02:11.365
I'll save Azalie, without fail!

00:02:12.265 --> 00:02:15.402
If you get in my way,
| won't forgive even you!

00:02:15.402 --> 00:02:16.403
Understand?!

00:02:42.763 --> 00:02:45.465
To trust the future to him, the road ahead...

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:05.285
So, it's tonight.

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:11.491
SORCERER Of moonlight

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:18.398
No, you can't Leki!

00:03:21.468 --> 00:03:23.970
Leki, are you okay?

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:26.339
| guess there's no helping it.

00:03:33.647 --> 00:03:36.316
Cleao, help me!

00:03:38.351 --> 00:03:41.221
It wasn't like I was trying to take your eggs!

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:43.957
It just happened that they
were in the mushrooms!

00:03:46.927 --> 00:03:49.496
Hey Maijic, get a hold of yourself!

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:52.165
Okay, if this happens...

00:03:57.037 --> 00:03:59.106
Fly Away, Sword of Light!

00:04:05.779 --> 00:04:06.780
It disappeared!

00:04:10.784 --> 00:04:14.154
Sorry! I'll give them back!

00:04:14.588 --> 00:04:16.990
| get it already!

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:19.626
Looks like we might not get
any dinner tonight, right, Leki?

00:04:37.878 --> 00:04:39.713
Sorry, did I wake you up?

00:04:39.713 --> 00:04:41.214
No, it's okay.

00:04:41.214 --> 00:04:43.517
| woke up because of Majic's uproar.

00:04:43.950 --> 00:04:46.319
You were tossing and turning last night too.

00:04:46.319 --> 00:04:49.156
You haven't been sleeping
much lately, have you?

00:04:49.156 --> 00:04:50.757
No, that's not like that.

00:04:50.757 --> 00:04:52.626
Is it about Miss Azalie?

00:04:54.961 --> 00:04:58.365
There are some things
you just can't settle by thinking.

00:04:58.365 --> 00:05:00.734
There are some things that, even if you worry,

00:05:00.734 --> 00:05:02.736
you can't do anything about until it happens.

00:05:06.439 --> 00:05:07.808
I'm going to take a walk.

00:05:13.079 --> 00:05:17.584
Hey! It's dark so if you walk
somewhere weird, you'll get lost!

00:05:17.584 --> 00:05:20.387
Hey, Orphen! Orphen!

00:05:21.588 --> 00:05:22.923
Geez...

00:05:25.192 --> 00:05:26.927
Sorry to keep you waiting, Cleao.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.796
Tonight's dinner became only this much...

00:05:31.398 --> 00:05:35.335
Cleao, you can't eat that raw. That's...

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.308
Cleao?

00:05:41.308 --> 00:05:42.509
Stupid!

00:06:13.139 --> 00:06:14.975
It's not right at all, Krylancelo!

00:06:16.042 --> 00:06:17.143
Krylancelo!

00:06:17.844 --> 00:06:18.845
Krylancelo!

00:06:21.715 --> 00:06:24.284
Krylancelo, what's the matter?

00:06:24.284 --> 00:06:25.952
It's not right at all!

00:06:26.419 --> 00:06:28.321
If you're going to do it with that attitude,

00:06:28.321 --> 00:06:30.790
then you may as well go back
to the Tower of Fangs right now!

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:31.791
Krylancelo...

00:06:34.728 --> 00:06:36.129
Hey, are you listening?

00:06:36.897 --> 00:06:40.500
If you do not concentrate,
magic is a most dangerous thing.

00:06:40.767 --> 00:06:41.902
Understand?

00:06:41.902 --> 00:06:43.904
Then, try it again.

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:45.005
Yes!

00:06:52.279 --> 00:06:53.847
Master Childman...

00:06:54.247 --> 00:06:55.482
What is it, Azalie?

00:06:55.482 --> 00:06:58.551
It seems Krylancelo needs to use the toilet.

00:06:58.551 --> 00:06:59.386
What?

00:06:59.386 --> 00:07:01.521
That's why he can't concentrate, you see?

00:07:02.289 --> 00:07:04.057
| guess there's no helping that.

00:07:04.057 --> 00:07:05.225
Hurry and go.

00:07:05.225 --> 00:07:06.226
Yes!

00:07:07.928 --> 00:07:11.665
Uncool, Krylancelo! Uncool!

00:07:21.308 --> 00:07:24.044
Master, where are you off to?

00:07:24.044 --> 00:07:25.545
| shall accompany you.

00:07:25.545 --> 00:07:28.114
It's personal business. You need not.

00:07:28.748 --> 00:07:30.383
Is it about Krylancelo?

00:07:30.383 --> 00:07:31.551
You're mistaken.

00:07:31.551 --> 00:07:33.586
Master, I have a favor to ask you.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.389
Tell Krylancelo the truth.

00:07:36.389 --> 00:07:38.291
The truth, please!

00:07:38.792 --> 00:07:42.028
Krylancelo hates you now, Master.

00:07:42.862 --> 00:07:45.365
He sees you as a murderer blinded by honor.

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:51.738
If you kill Bloody August, Master,
so long as you have the heart,

00:07:51.738 --> 00:07:54.541
you would someday be able
to regenerate Azalie.

00:07:54.708 --> 00:07:58.178
But it's not possible for Krylancelo,
at his current level.

00:07:58.178 --> 00:08:01.781
Not only that, he might lose his life!

00:08:02.282 --> 00:08:07.187
That's why you're trying to keep
Krylancelo from Bloody August.

00:08:08.054 --> 00:08:10.590
Please tell him this truth.

00:08:11.057 --> 00:08:13.393
Krylancelo is not an idiot.

00:08:13.393 --> 00:08:16.096
He will understand. He will!

00:08:31.711 --> 00:08:32.712
Hartia...

00:08:32.712 --> 00:08:34.247
Yes, Master?

00:08:35.715 --> 00:08:38.985
Should I return from this journey,
I shall then tell him.

00:08:40.954 --> 00:08:42.455
Krylancelo...

00:08:44.391 --> 00:08:45.658
Thank you very much!

00:08:46.359 --> 00:08:48.595
There's no reason for you to thank me.

00:08:51.164 --> 00:08:53.767
Then I shall entrust you
during my absence, Hartia.

00:08:53.767 --> 00:08:55.835
Yes, please be careful.

00:09:08.982 --> 00:09:11.484
So you're finally making your move, Childman?

00:09:11.484 --> 00:09:14.087
I'll catch your tail!

00:09:29.302 --> 00:09:30.403
You're
wrong!

00:09:30.403 --> 00:09:31.671
How am I wrong?

00:09:31.671 --> 00:09:33.673
Childman kills his students without a thought!

00:09:33.673 --> 00:09:35.341
He doesn't have tears or blood.
He's a murderer!

00:09:35.341 --> 00:09:37.277
You don't understand Master.

00:09:37.944 --> 00:09:40.313
You have the wrong impression of
what kind of person Childman is!

00:09:40.313 --> 00:09:41.514
The wrong impression?

00:09:42.015 --> 00:09:45.118
He is... You know, he is...

00:09:46.252 --> 00:09:47.420
Hartia...

00:09:52.025 --> 00:09:53.293
Look, Dortin!

00:09:53.593 --> 00:09:54.494
Big Brother...

00:09:55.862 --> 00:09:58.932
They say that a rabbit makes
rice cakes over there.

00:09:58.932 --> 00:10:02.268
If it's that big, then even if we
ate that rice cake for weeks,

00:10:02.268 --> 00:10:05.572
we might not be able to eat them all!

00:10:05.572 --> 00:10:07.440
Could be right.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.942
Wanna eat some?

00:10:08.942 --> 00:10:12.412
But it'd be a lot of work
to haul it over here, Big Brother.

00:10:12.412 --> 00:10:14.948
You two! What are you doing over there?

00:10:15.782 --> 00:10:19.085
So, you popped out again,
super evil black sorcerer!

00:10:19.085 --> 00:10:22.388
What do you guys think this field is anyway?

00:10:22.388 --> 00:10:24.424
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:10:24.424 --> 00:10:29.295
How dare you admonish Mazmaturia's
Battle Hound, Vulcan Volcano?!

00:10:29.295 --> 00:10:31.464
You're too young by 250 million years for that!

00:10:31.464 --> 00:10:33.967
Wow! You sure came up with
a bold one, Big Brother!

00:10:33.967 --> 00:10:36.169
Even the dinosaurs would've been shocked!

00:10:36.169 --> 00:10:38.505
If dinosaurs saw the likes of me,

00:10:38.505 --> 00:10:40.907
they'd prostrate themselves
before my astounding dignity!

00:10:40.907 --> 00:10:42.609
Ouch! Ouch! Ouch! Ouch!

00:10:42.609 --> 00:10:44.777
Hey, what are you doing? Let me go, you!

00:10:44.777 --> 00:10:46.212
If you don't let go of me,

00:10:46.212 --> 00:10:48.381
I'll hop you to death on a moonlit night!

00:10:48.381 --> 00:10:50.817
I'm asking you what you're doing here!

00:10:51.017 --> 00:10:52.819
You're mistaken, Mister Orphen.

00:10:52.819 --> 00:10:56.322
Big Brother is really not
planning anything today!

00:10:56.623 --> 00:10:58.825
We were wandering around hungry,

00:10:58.825 --> 00:11:02.095
and then the moon came out
and looked so delicious, so...

00:11:03.062 --> 00:11:04.130
Orphen!

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:05.265
Master!

00:11:05.265 --> 00:11:08.034
How did you guys find this place?

00:11:08.034 --> 00:11:10.069
This cutie showed us.

00:11:21.414 --> 00:11:23.316
What strange ruins.

00:11:24.517 --> 00:11:27.320
They call this the Summit of Moonlight.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.055
Summit of Moonlight?

00:11:30.156 --> 00:11:34.360
It's a beautiful moon.
| can see how people would say that.

00:11:34.961 --> 00:11:36.062
Yeah...

00:11:36.062 --> 00:11:37.630
It's true.

00:11:49.842 --> 00:11:52.078
| know Azalie's goal.

00:11:52.412 --> 00:11:55.582
She did not attack
the Tower of Fangs in revenge.

00:11:56.182 --> 00:11:58.218
She was looking for me.

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:08.995
Azalie has realized it is not possible
to return to her former body.

00:12:09.529 --> 00:12:12.732
But she can trade places
with anything that has a soul.

00:12:16.469 --> 00:12:19.172
So Azalie choose me.

00:12:32.018 --> 00:12:35.388
Azalie, your suffering will end tonight.

00:12:35.388 --> 00:12:39.359
| promise I will return you to your former state.

00:12:39.359 --> 00:12:42.562
Until then, you will sleep restfully.

00:12:43.463 --> 00:12:44.530
O Fire!

00:12:48.067 --> 00:12:51.337
This field is really a moondial.

00:12:51.337 --> 00:12:53.840
Moondial? What's that?

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.942
Is it something like a sundial?

00:12:55.942 --> 00:13:00.480
Yes, instead of sunlight,
it marks time with moonlight.

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:02.081
But how?

00:13:02.081 --> 00:13:03.416
I'll show you right now.

00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:14.327
Oh, I see.

00:13:14.327 --> 00:13:17.597
A person gets on that platform
and becomes the needle.

00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:26.906
Move! Move! Let me do it too!

00:13:33.646 --> 00:13:34.514
The shadow...

00:13:34.514 --> 00:13:35.748
Doesn't reach!

00:13:36.582 --> 00:13:38.618
What a sad turn of events!

00:13:38.618 --> 00:13:41.087
You! If it comes to this, then here!

00:13:41.087 --> 00:13:44.524
There! There!

00:13:50.229 --> 00:13:51.998
It's because you get so caught up with things.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:11.818
Majic...

00:14:11.818 --> 00:14:13.219
Yes, Master?

00:14:13.553 --> 00:14:15.688
Want to try and fight me?

00:14:29.335 --> 00:14:30.536
O wall!

00:14:34.507 --> 00:14:36.909
Azalie, don't fight me.

00:14:37.377 --> 00:14:38.444
O Wind!

00:14:48.221 --> 00:14:49.489
Azalie...

00:14:54.193 --> 00:14:56.529
Hey! Hey! Go! Go, Majic!

00:14:56.529 --> 00:14:58.030
Is that the best you can do?

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:00.233
Don't lose! Don't lose, Majic!

00:15:00.233 --> 00:15:02.668
Beat Orphen, now!

00:15:02.668 --> 00:15:04.570
Hey! Hey! Go! Go!

00:15:11.043 --> 00:15:12.345
Not yet?

00:15:21.354 --> 00:15:22.355
Childman...

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:26.192
Oh, it's nothing.

00:15:28.661 --> 00:15:30.196
What's this?

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.899
What in the world?

00:15:35.301 --> 00:15:36.969
It's begun.

00:16:01.727 --> 00:16:04.530
Majic, try casting a spell on me.

00:16:05.198 --> 00:16:07.533
Even if you say to all of the sudden...

00:16:07.533 --> 00:16:09.435
It doesn't have to be anything special.

00:16:09.435 --> 00:16:11.270
Okay, I understand.

00:16:14.106 --> 00:16:16.342
Fly Away, Sword of Light!

00:16:17.477 --> 00:16:20.646
That's funny. Earlier...

00:16:21.547 --> 00:16:23.149
One more time!

00:16:23.149 --> 00:16:24.817
Sword of Light!

00:16:26.953 --> 00:16:29.722
That's no good! Get a hold of yourself.

00:16:29.722 --> 00:16:31.324
This is weird.

00:16:31.324 --> 00:16:34.126
Sorry, Master, it won't come.

00:16:34.460 --> 00:16:36.762
There's no reason to apologize, Majic.

00:16:36.762 --> 00:16:39.599
This is what I wanted to show you.

00:16:39.599 --> 00:16:40.833
What do you mean?

00:16:40.833 --> 00:16:42.435
A magic containment field.

00:16:42.435 --> 00:16:44.170
Magic containment field?

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:46.739
At a certain time on the night of a full moon,

00:16:46.739 --> 00:16:49.442
if a sorcerer becomes
the needle of the moondial,

00:16:49.442 --> 00:16:53.079
a warding encompassing
this whole area will be set into place.

00:16:53.279 --> 00:16:59.285
And for one moment, the people inside
will have their magical powers taken away.

00:17:00.419 --> 00:17:03.222
In the end, this is what magic is.

00:17:03.222 --> 00:17:05.825
What you should polish is your human soul.

00:17:05.825 --> 00:17:08.160
That is the road to being a true sorcerer.

00:17:08.628 --> 00:17:10.630
You three should learn that well.

00:17:18.337 --> 00:17:19.939
You don't understand Master...

00:17:19.939 --> 00:17:22.441
You have the wrong impression
of the kind of person Childman is!

00:17:26.112 --> 00:17:28.948
Maybe I'll believe in Hartia.

00:17:41.694 --> 00:17:43.896
Sleep, Azalie.

00:17:49.035 --> 00:17:49.936
O wind!

00:17:52.538 --> 00:17:55.641
| see, someone is at the Summit of Moonlight.

00:17:55.908 --> 00:17:59.078
| will take Azalie's life!

00:17:59.078 --> 00:18:00.513
Flameheart!

00:19:16.622 --> 00:19:18.691
Farewell, Childman.

00:19:19.992 --> 00:19:21.260
Azalie...

00:19:54.994 --> 00:19:57.697
O Wind, become a blade of light!

00:20:10.376 --> 00:20:15.281
Farewell, your life shall end
with that hideous body.

00:20:46.312 --> 00:20:47.613
Are you all right?

00:20:49.715 --> 00:20:50.950
Yes...

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.324
Childman...

00:21:37.963 --> 00:21:41.133
The moon tonight is especially beautiful.

00:22:16.936 --> 00:22:20.906
What?! The Tower of Fangs
is trying to capture Orphen?!

00:22:20.906 --> 00:22:23.442
We don't have time for that!

00:22:23.442 --> 00:22:25.778
A dog about to have babies,
an old lady, and an old man

00:22:25.778 --> 00:22:28.814
have been abandoned near the volcano!

00:22:29.081 --> 00:22:31.650
So you've come again, Shrimp Man!

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:34.787
Who are you anyway?
Orphen's friend? His foe?

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:37.122
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:37.122 --> 00:22:37.489
"The Shrimp Man Comes Again."

00:22:37.489 --> 00:22:38.824
The shrimp man cComes agam
"The Shrimp Man Comes Again."

00:22:38.824 --> 00:22:41.327
The shrimp man cComes agam
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:41.327 --> 00:22:41.861
The shrimp man
COMeES again

00:22:43.362 --> 00:22:44.897
What should I do?

00:22:44.897 --> 00:22:47.299
I need you to come after me

00:22:47.299 --> 00:22:51.537
Even if I just kept on walking

00:22:53.105 --> 00:22:54.673
What should I do?

00:22:54.673 --> 00:22:57.109
We wouldn't be able to meet

00:22:57.109 --> 00:23:01.413
Even if we knew each other's cell phone numbers

00:23:01.981 --> 00:23:06.852
Headlights illuminate me

00:23:06.852 --> 00:23:11.156
They're too bright, so I close my eyes

00:23:11.790 --> 00:23:14.193
If I kick my high heels off

00:23:14.193 --> 00:23:16.662
And hold them in both hands

00:23:16.662 --> 00:23:21.734
I could even throw away my pride

00:23:21.901 --> 00:23:30.476
For the first time, I feel like
I might do something really unfair

00:23:31.677 --> 00:23:42.354
I just want to collapse on the street and cry

00:23:43.289 --> 00:23:47.793
Looking for you and fall in love

00:23:48.527 --> 00:23:52.731
Because I'm not really so strong

00:23:53.465 --> 00:23:57.536
If you kissed me right now

00:23:58.337 --> 00:24:02.975
I'd cry, what should I do?

00:24:03.275 --> 00:24:08.981
What should I do with this love?
